ng, bit-crushed edges, cassette grime, low-end bloated and overdriven, everything slightly detuned and hostile.\nVocal Details: Low aggressive vocal, gritted-teeth delivery between a growl and a chant, pushed forward in the mix and doubled hard left and right, on-top-of-the-beat attacking phrasing, raspy dark timbre. Sparse shouted gang-vocal answers, occasional pitched-down whispered threats and reversed vocal swells drowned in dark plate reverb and slapback delay. Long instrumental stretches where the beat alone does the talking.\nArrangement: Punishing 808 drums with a distorted sliding sub-bass kick that saturates the whole low end, cracking rim-knock snare dead on the beat, double-time skittering hi-hats with sharp triplet bursts, cowbell stabs from classic phonk. Detuned horror-movie bell melody as the harmonic bed, gnarled low brass hits answering the vocal lines, constant tape grime and air-raid siren swells as texture. Intro: lone detuned bell loop over cassette hiss, a pitched-down voice mutters once, then the 808s slam in all at once. Verses: minimal and heavy — 808 kick, snare, hats, bells, whispered ad-libs between lines. Instrumental sections: the bell melody and brass stabs trade blows over the beat, sub-bass slides dragging underneath, occasional distorted siren far in the background. Bridge: drums cut to silence except hiss and one detuned bell, a whispered count-in, then the beat drops back twice as hard with layered gang shouts. Outro: everything cuts at once mid-bar, leaving one last bell note ringing into tape hiss.","I'm yelling murdah\nevery weekend\nfucking all ya chica\npacking bodies in\nthe freezer\nwhile we fuckin'\non ya speakers\n\n\n"]},{"id":22,"type":"PreviewAudio","pos":[1460.0518535184651,938.6189016028115],"size":[360,102],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","link":11},{"localized_name":"audioUI","name":"audioUI","type":"AUDIO_UI","widget":{"name":"audioUI"},"link":null}]